    "body": "# omp-spec-kit v0.3.2\n\n## Included correction\n\n- MCP launches against the active OMP project rather than package cwd.\n- Invalid JSON-RPC request objects receive terminal protocol errors.\n- The read-only MCP surface remains exactly eight tools.\n\n## Verified candidate\n\n- Candidate digest: `526ef6ff94ea682a116a43e4de0b5f622686b8ef36648b7884c830ba1eac25b4`\n- Package tree digest: `e8d53934122a495e1003f17126785dcd181f5d6d5f417270844e17fc25f12f92`\n- Archive SHA-256: `26a2ebadd7d1888c10dc9bdbdc25e11fecf5a7dcc7515b15c7e3bb363a0cbea9`\n- Peelled tag commit: `2938389e34e2d06bdd497291ed01e0a2d89146c9`\n\nInstall or upgrade at project scope, reload plugin metadata, then start a fresh OMP session before invoking MCP tools.\n"
